; Body resolution consumes one source-shaped catalog rather than repeatedly
; rediscovering declaration ownership or assigning opaque numeric node ids.
; Each row retains one original top-level syntax value. Fields, cases, boundary
; members, and states stay inside that owner instead of becoming a second flat
; tree. Q4 entry candidates and all body/control candidates remain later facts.
(data DeltaCatalogMachineOwner
  (DeltaCatalogUnqualifiedMachine)
  (DeltaCatalogDataMachineOwner DeltaDeclaration)
  (DeltaCatalogUnknownMachineOwner DeltaName))

(data DeltaCatalogDeclaration
  (DeltaCatalogBoundaryDeclaration DeltaDeclaration)
  (DeltaCatalogDataDeclaration DeltaDeclaration DeltaDataShapeKind)
  (DeltaCatalogMachineDeclaration DeltaDeclaration DeltaCatalogMachineOwner))

